#
#   Run scoped tests for each user whose files are staged, i.e. for a staged
#   users/<name>/*, run that user's suite under users/<name>/tests/ and block
#   the commit on failure. Scoped rather than repo-wide so the gate stays fast.
#
#   Depends on: a per-user test runner existing, and tests/ being populated.
#   Do NOT implement until those exist — see CLAUDE.md > Testing.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

exit 0
